/- File: SessionMultiLib/Degree.lean

  The session half of the degree.ml translation: it supplies
  HolMultiLib.Degree's dependencies (polytope.ml's `PolytopeDeps`, the extra
  theorems from Session, SessionLibrary and SessionMultiLib, and the
  procedure), and exports every theorem by name.  Importing this module is
  `needs "Multivariate/degree.ml"`: its own `needs` (homology.ml and
  polytope.ml) are the imports of SessionMultiLib.Polytope, which imports
  SessionMultiLib.Homology through SessionMultiLib.Paths, and each bundle is
  built by `initialize` when the module is loaded, in file order.
-/

